  "about": {
    "title": "About the Fates Collide set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Fates Collide is a XY expansion released on 2 May 2016. It has 129 cards: 124 in the main set and 1 secret rare and 4 alternate versions. There are also 99 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 124 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (223 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 228 cards, adding the 1 secret rare and 4 alternate versions).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
